R, McKinley A. Surgeons'' leadership in the operating room: an observational study. Am J Surg . 2012; 204 3: 347– 354. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 37. Fernandez R, Vozenilek JA, Hegarty CB, Motola I, Reznek M, Phrampus PE, et al. Developing expert medical teams: toward an evidence-based approach. Acad Emerg Med . 2008; 15 11: 1025– 1036. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 38. Shapiro MJ, Gardner R, Godwin SA, Jay GD, Lindquist DG, Salisbury ML, et al. Defining team performance for simulation-based training: methodology, metrics, and opportunities for emergency medicine. Acad Emerg Med . 2008; 15 11: 1088– 1097. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 39. Salzman DH, Franzen DS, Leone KA, Kessler CS. Assessing practice-based learning and improvement. Acad Emerg Med . 2012; 19 12: 1403– 1410. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 40. Takayesu JK, Kulstad C, Wallenstein J, Gallahue F, Gordon D, Leone K, et al. Assessing patient care: summary of the breakout group on assessment of observable learner performance. Acad Emerg Med . 2012; 19 12: 1379– 1389. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 41. Chan TM, Wallner C, Swoboda TK, Leone KA, Kessler C. Assessing interpersonal and communication skills in emergency medicine. Acad Emerg Med . 2012; 19 12: 1390– 1402. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 42. Rodriguez E, Siegelman J, Leone K, Kessler C. Assessing professionalism: summary of the working group on assessment of observable learner performance. Acad Emerg Med . 2012; 19 12: 1372– 1378. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 43. Chen EH, O''Sullivan PS, Pfennig CL, Leone K, Kessler CS. Assessing systems-based practice. Acad Emerg Med . 2012; 19 12: 1366– 1371. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 44. Goyal N, Aldeen A, Leone K, Ilgen JS, Branzetti J, Kessler C. Assessing medical knowledge of emergency medicine residents. Acad Emerg Med . 2012; 19 12: 1360– 1365. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 45. Reznek M, Smith-Coggins R, Howard S, Kiran K, Harter P