tions. Plast Reconstr Surg Glob Open 2023; 11:e4892. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Hoyt WT. Rater bias in psychological research: when is it a problem and what can we do about it? Psychol Methods 2000; 5:64–86. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 24. Ellis R, Oeppen RS, Brennan PA. Virtual postgraduate exams and assessments: the challenges of online delivery and optimising performance. Br J Oral Maxillofac Surg 2021; 59:233–237. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials Supplemental Digital Content ejanet-41-921-s001.jpg (92.2KB, jpg) Supplemental Digital Content ejanet-41-921-s002.docx (97.3KB, docx) Supplemental Digital Content ejanet-41-921-s003.docx (47.7KB, docx) Supplemental Digital Content ejanet-41-921-s004.docx (81.9KB, docx) Supplemental Digital Content ejanet-41-921-s005.docx (39.3KB, docx)',33,'2025-10-15 11:10:19','2025-10-15 11:10:19');
INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(5348,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5709210','The intensive care delirium research agenda: a multinational, interprofessional perspective.','Pandharipande PP, Ely EW, Arora RC, Balas MC, Boustani MA, La Calle GH, Cunningham C, Devlin JW, Elefante J, Han JH, MacLullich AM, Maldonado JR, Morandi A, Needham DM, Page VJ, Rose L, Salluh JIF, Sharshar T, Shehabi Y, Skrobik Y, Slooter AJC, Smith HAB.','2017','fluctuates intoxicating hypoactive hypoactive portend lumping promulgation icdsc icdsc outweighs abcdef arly omfort nalgesia edation umane ecash abcdef abcdef ssessment cpot oth hoice rass elirium icdsc pcam pscam capd arly amily omfort nalgesia edation umane ecash deliriogenic hypoactive fearful hypoactive ziprasidone caecal pcam pscam capd icdsc evolvement portend icdsc idelirium abcdef nidus epiphenomenon temporality delirious arousable hypoactive dahlia contradicted decs await rivastigmine rivastigmine rivastigmine guanfacine terminating untestable confusional hypoactive hypoactive overlooking ramelteon ramelteon triphasic delirious electrographic ncse ncse humanizing innovating humanization r01hl111111 r01ag r24hl111895 r24ag054259 r01ag r01hl111111 grecc slooter stw h2020 1r21g04567212 shehabi hospira hospira mallinckrodt slooter shehabi hospira pratik grecc rakesh boniface winnipeg balas malaz boustani heras calle humanizing proyecto torrejon colm trinity trinity elefante alasdair maclullich morandi ancelle cremona valerie watford sunnybrook salluh tarek sharshar poincare yahya shehabi yoanna skrobik arjen slooter heidi carell shintani truman speroff inouye dittus shintani pun dittus 0b013e31814b2c4d shintani 0b013e31826ab49b pun dittus thomason shintani motoric meagher adamis trzepacz jpsychores morandi pun brummel vasilevskis shintani geevarghese canonico dittus nejmoa1301372 brummel chandrasekhar brummel pun vasilevskis morandi shintani dittus icussi wassenaar boogaard achterberg slooter hoogendoorn maseda luetz schandl v